  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Senegal Min Sector Diagnostic &amp; Cap Bldg</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity aims to conduction a diagnostic review of the mineral  sector of Senegal, to identify reform priorities, and build the government capacity to manage the mineral sector. The Development Objective of this grant is to improve the institutional capacity of the Ministry of Mines, Industry and Transformation to negotiate mineral agreements and monitor fiscal, safety, health, and environmental requirements of mining operations in Senegal. .</narrative>
  </description>
